+Use case: precise-object-edit
+Edit target image1: our original fictional masked shooter32-frame pixel-art sprite atlas,1536x1024 RGBA,8columns4rows,192x256 cells. This is our own original game art, no real person or real organization.
+SPECIFIC CONTINUITY REPAIR ONLY: FOUR IDLE CELLS, first TWO cells in TOP row(DOWN) and first TWO cells in BOTTOM row(UP). These idles crouch6native pixels shorter than walking counterparts; beginning to walk looks like the whole figure suddenly grows. Re-author ONLY those4idle poses with NATURAL STRAIGHTER LEGS, PELVIS/SHOULDER/HEAD hierarchy matching standing/walking body proportions in columns2–7 of the SAME row. Keep body mass, helmet size/shape and armor plate size identical to walking frames. Draw proper legs/knee armor/shins and posture; do NOT uniformly resize/stretch the whole character, helmet or torso as a shortcut.
+In the192x256 master cells, use head top aroundy30–34 and sole bottom aroundy237–241 for these four idle figures, consistent with walkcol2–7. At48x64 native after foot anchory58 this should put helmet top aroundy6–8 both idle and walk, with only1–2pixel natural bob, not5–6pixel growth. Chest armor, shoulder pads and gun height should line up across transition, not merely the top pixel. Two idles remain still/braced with a subtle one-pixel breathing change. Legs are under the same weight, not a new running pose.
+Preserve all other28frames EXACTLY, including LEFT and RIGHT rows and existing DOWN/UP walk cycles. Preserve exact8×4grid/cell placement, cyan-grey pistol silhouette in both hands, closed angular darkhelmet, opaque redvisor, charcoal trousers/boots, crimson/magenta chest/back armor, compact medium build, steep overhead camera, fully anonymous maskedidentity. This is a posture/anatomy redraw of4cells only, NOT a new design.
+Style: same genuine low-resolution pixel-art square clusters (logical48x64 displayed4x nearest), hard edges, shared controlled colors, no antialiasing, no smooth gradients, no real/painterly textures. All poses completely inside their own cells with transparent margin. Actual zero-alpha background, no glow, floor shadow, matte, text, grid lines, labels or other objects. Preserve original composition and colors.
